    {
      "source": "Render a <a href=\"../../relational/core/sql/SqlIdentifier.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>SqlIdentifier</code></a> in a way suitable for registering it as a generated key with a statement through\n<code>Statement#returnGeneratedValues</code>.",
      "translation": "以适合通过 <code>Statement#returnGeneratedValues</code> 将其注册为生成键的方式渲染一个 <a href=\"../../relational/core/sql/SqlIdentifier.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>SqlIdentifier</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Render a <a href=\"../../relational/core/sql/SqlIdentifier.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>SqlIdentifier</code></a> in a way suitable for registering it as a generated key with a statement through\n<code>Statement#returnGeneratedValues</code>. The default implementation renders it as it would render a SQL\nrepresentation of the identifier, i.e. with quotes where applicable.",
      "translation": "将 <a href=\"../../relational/core/sql/SqlIdentifier.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>SqlIdentifier</code></a> 渲染为适合通过 <code>Statement#returnGeneratedValues</code> 注册为生成键的形式。默认实现会将其渲染为标识符的 SQL 表示形式，即在适用处添加引号。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "R2DBC-specific extension to <a href=\"../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a>. Represents a dialect that is implemented by a particular database.",
      "translation": "针对<a href=\"../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a>的 R2DBC 特定扩展。表示由特定数据库实现的方言。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a collection of types that are natively supported by this database/driver. Defaults to\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collections.html#emptySet()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collections.emptySet()</code></a>.",
